<title>FINLAND: FINNISH T-BILL AUCTION RAISES FIM 379 MLN.</title>
<headline>FINNISH T-BILL AUCTION RAISES FIM 379 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the State Treasury Office's T-Bill auction August 12 versus August 5  SUVK :</p>
<p>			THIS AUCTION/PREVIOUS AUCTION</p>
<p> Maturity, days   183/161		335/342</p>
<p> Avge yld, pct   3.24/3.15	    3.55/3.49</p>
<p> Highest yld     3.25/3.15	    3.55/3.49</p>
<p> Lowest  yld     3.24/3.14	    3.54/3.49</p>
<p> Amount,FIM million   284/80		  95/130</p>
<p> Bids, FIM million    384/160		175/360</p>
<p>After today's auction, the outstanding amount of treasury bills is 46,412 million markka, the STO said. @</p>
<p>STO had said it would issue at most 800 million markka worth of T-Bills in Tuesday's auction.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@Reuters.fi</p>
</text>
